Author: der richter <der.richter@gmx.de>
Date:   Sat Oct 24 14:11:20 2026 +0200

    ao_coreaudio: remove misusage of audio unit channel map API
    
    we are misusing the audio unit API to set properties for the
    kAudioOutputUnitProperty_ChannelMap property, by passing a
    AudioChannelLayout instead of an array of SInt32 as required. why this
    worked at all, prior to macOS 27, can only be assumed. with the release
    of macOS 27 this throws a hard error, preventing coreaudio from being
    initialised completely and falling back to av_foundation.
    
    introduced in PR #15622
    commit 06fe665b789ffca7c6716cd4ca2fec7e2d0f54be
    
    this PR fixed the problem in #15584, probably by coincidence.
    
    partially revert the changes from mentioned PR/commit on the coreaudio
    side and reintroducing #15584. this wasn't completely and properly fixed
    anyway.
    
    Fixes #18384

